Z||000011||Cheever2||03-12-2001||08:59 AM||||Airborne arranges ground freight.  Much cheaper than air yet doesn't take that much longer.  Their customers are mostly high volume companies, but they will do it for you.  Their computer system finds a truck going your way which is not full, and makes an electronic bid to the trucking company.  It's very quick.  I know as a former employee, not as a customer, and cannot tell you what the cost would be.  Have you called them?<BR> ||||reg||6
