Z||000015||terryk||03-12-2001||02:46 PM||||I used Canadian Air but I doubt they will route in the US.<P>Yes, bring a lift because they will set the engine on a dock 10 ft in the air. We finally got them to use a forklift to set it in the truck but only after saying that we couldn't move it for them to do other transfers.<p>[This message has been edited by terryk (edited 03-12-2001).]||||reg||1
